@Library.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Criar Livro
POST {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0134494166",
  "totalCopies": 5
}

### 2. Listar Livros
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/books?onlyActive=true
Accept: application/json

### 3. Consultar Livro por Id
# Substitua pelo ID gerado
@bookId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/books/{{bookId}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. Atualizar Livro (PATCH /books/{id})
PATCH {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/books/{{bookId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Clean Architecture - Updated",
  "author": "Robert C. Martin",
  "isbn": "978-0134494166",
  "totalCopies": 6
}

### 5. Consultar Disponibilidade de Livro
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/books/{{bookId}}/availability
Accept: application/json

### 6. Consultar Histórico de Empréstimos do Livro
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/books/{{bookId}}/history
Accept: application/json

### 7. Cadastrar Usuário/Leitor
POST {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 8. Realizar Empréstimo (com Idempotency-Key)
@userId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/loans
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: idemp-req-001

{
  "bookId": "{{bookId}}",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "expectedReturnDateUtc": "2026-11-15T00:00:00Z"
}

### 9. Devolver Empréstimo
@loanId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
POST {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/loans/{{loanId}}/return

### 10. Cancelar Empréstimo
POST {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/loans/{{loanId}}/cancel
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cancelamento solicitado pelo usuário."
}

### 11. Consultar Empréstimos do Usuário
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/users/{{userId}}/loans
Accept: application/json

### 12. Consultar Trilha de Auditoria
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/audit-events
Accept: application/json

### 13. Health Check Live
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/health/live

### 14. Health Check Ready
GET {{Library.API_HostAddress}}/health/ready
